CM_ BO_ 2566844672 "Vehicle Speed 4/4. Cruise control vehicle speed.
Bosch AS need vehicle speed in ASIL D, therefore 2 sources with ASIL B or 4 sources with ASIL A should be available in the vehicle.";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 ParkingBrakeSwitch "Switch signal which indicates when the parking brake is set.In general the switch actuated by theoperator's park brake control, whether a pedal, lever or other control mechanism.";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CruiseCtrlPauseSwitch "Switch signal which indicates the position of the Cruise Control Pause Switch used on Remote CruiseControl applications.";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 WheelBasedVehicleSpeed "Speed of the vehicle as calculated from wheel or tailshaft speed.";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CruiseCtrlActive "Cruise control is switched on. It is not ensured that the engine is controlled by cruise control, as in thecase of a large driver's demand the engine is controlled by the driver while cruise control is active(maximum selection of cruise control and driver's demand). The cruise control is set to 0 if a switchoff condition occurs.";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CruiseCtrlEnableSwitch "Switch signal which indicates that it is possible to manage the cruise control function.
00 - Cruise control disabled
01 - Cruise control enabled
10 - Error
11 - NA";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 BrakeSwitch "指示驾驶员操纵的制动脚踏板被踩下。这个制动脚踏板是控制车辆的服务制动(全车辆制动，不是停车制动)。为了保证传动系统的安全，必须在物理制动部件被激活之前启动开关(即在摩擦刹车激活之前断开巡航控制功能)。
00 - Brake pedal released
01 - Brake pedal depressed
10 - Error
11 - Not Available";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 ClutchSwitch "指示离合器踏板被踩下的开关信号。为了保证传动系统的安全，离合器开关必须在离合器打开前设置(巡航控制功能)。
00 - Clutch pedal released
01 - Clutch pedal depressed
10 - Error
11 - Not available";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 z_CruiseCtrlSetSwitch "Switch signal of the cruise control activator which indicates that the activator is in the position [set].
00 - Cruise control activator not in the position [set]
01 - Cruise control activator in position [set]
10 - Error
11 - NA";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CruiseCtrlResumeSwitch "Switch signal of the cruise control activator which indicates that the activator is in the position resume
00 - Cruise control activator not in the position  [resume]
01 - Cruise control activator in position [resume]
10 - Error
11 - NA";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CruiseCtrlSetSpeed "Value of set (chosen) velocity of velocity control system.  See SPN 6809 for an alternate resolution.
If an algorithm that can modify the cruise control set point exists in the system, such as Predictive Cruise Control or Adaptive Cruise Control, ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 PTOGovernorState "This parameter is used to indicate the current state or mode of operation by the power takeoff (PTO) governor.  In lieu of support for PTO Drive Engagement parameters, this parameter may represent the status of a PTO drive.  The broadcasting device ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CruiseCtrlStates "This parameter is used to indicate the current state, or mode, of operation by the cruise control device.  This is a status parameter.
000 - Off/Disabled
001 - Hold
010 - Accelerate
011 - Decelerate
100 - Resume
101 - Set
110 - Accelerator …";
CM_ SG_ 2565866755 SelectedGear "The gear that the transmission will attempt to achieve during the current shift if a shift is in progress,or the next shift if one is pending (i.e., waiting for torque reduction to initiate the shift).Negativevalues are reverse gears positive values are forward gears zero is neutral 251 (0xFB) is park";
CM_ SG_ 2565866755 ActualGearRatio "Actual ratio of input shaft speed to output shaft speed.";
CM_ SG_ 2565866755 CurrentGear "The gear currently engaged in the transmission or the last gear engaged while the transmission is inthe process of shifting to the new or selected gear. Transitions toward a destination gear will not beindicated. Once the selected gear has been engaged then Current Gear will reflect that gear.Negativevalues are reverse gears positive values are forward gears zero is neutral 251 (0xFB) is park";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 EPB_GuardLampSts "保护灯状态";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 EPB_AmberWarningLightSts "琥珀色警示灯状态";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 EPB_RedStopLightSts "红色停止灯状态";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 EPB_FaultIndicatorSts "故障指示灯状态";
