CM_ BO_ 2565865739 "Electronic　Brake Controller#1";
CM_ SG_ 2565865739 ASREngCtrlActive "State signal which indicates that ASR engine control has been commanded to be active. Active means that ASR actually tries tocontrol the engine. This state signal is independent of other control commands to the engine (e.g., from the transmission) whichmay have higher priority.
状态信号，指示ASR引擎控制已被命令激活。Active意味着ASR实际上试图控制引擎。这种状态信号独立于其他可能具有更高优先级的引擎控制命令(例如，来自传动系)。";
CM_ SG_ 2565865739 ASRBrakeCtrlActive "State signal which indicates that ASR brake control is active. Active means that ASR actually controls wheel brake pressure at one or more wheels of the driven axle(s).
状态信号，指示ASR制动控制激活。Active意味着ASR实际上控制一个或多个车轮的从动轴的制动压力。";
CM_ SG_ 2565865739 ABSActive "State signal which indicates that the ABS is active. The signal is set active when wheel brake pressure actually starts to bemodulated by ABS and is reset to passive when all wheels are in a stable condition for a certain time. The signal can also be setactive when driven wheels are in high slip (e.g., caused by retarder). Whenever the ABS system is not fully operational (due to adefect or during off-road ABS operation) , this signal is only valid for that part of the system that is still working. When ABS";
CM_ SG_ 2565865739 EBSBrakeSwitch "Switch signal which indicates that the brake pedal is being pressed.The EBS brake switch is independent of the brake light switchand has no provisions for external connections.
指示正在踩下刹车踏板的开关信号。EBS制动开关独立于制动灯开关，没有外部连接的规定。";
CM_ SG_ 2565865739 BrakePedalPos "Ratio of brake pedal position to maximum pedal position. Used for electric brake applications. 0% means no braking.Also whenthere are two brake pedals on the machine,the maximum of the two should be transmitted for Brake Pedal Position.
制动踏板位置百分比";
CM_ SG_ 2565865739 ABSOffroadSwitch "Switch signal which indicates the position of the ABS off-road switch.
ABS越野开关";
CM_ SG_ 2565865739 ASROffroadSwitch "Switch signal which indicates the position of the ASR off-road switch.";
CM_ SG_ 2565865739 ASRHillHolderSwitch "Switch signal which indicates the position of the ASR 'hill holder' switch.
ASR 坡路防滑开关";
CM_ SG_ 2565865739 ABSFullyOperational "Signal which indicates whether an ABS system is fully operational or whether its functionality is reduced by a defect or by anintended action (e.g., by activation of an ABS-off-road switch or during special diagnostic procedures). There are cases where thesignal is necessary to fulfill legal regulations for special applications (e.g., switching off integrated retarders).
表明ABS系统是否完全运行或其功能是否因缺陷或预期操作而降低的信号(例如，通过激活ABS-越野开关或在特殊诊断过程中)。在某些情况下，信号是必要的，以满足特殊应用的法律规定(例如，关闭集成的缓速器)。";
CM_ SG_ 2565865739 EBSRedWarningSignal "This parameter commands the EBS red optical warning signal.
EBS红色警报";
CM_ SG_ 2565865739 ABS_EBSAmberWarningSignal "This parameter commands the ABS/EBS amber/yellow optical warning signal.
ABS_EBS琥珀色警报灯";
CM_ SG_ 2565865739 ATC_ASRInfoSignal "This parameter commands the ATC/ASR driver information signal, for example a dash lamp.
此参数命令ATC/ASR驾驶员指示信息信号，如仪表灯。";
CM_ SG_ 2565865739 SrcAddrssOfCntrllngDvcFrBrkeCtrl "The source address of the SAE J1939 device currently controlling the brake system.
EBS制动控制源地址";
CM_ SG_ 2565865739 TrailerMountedABSWarning "This parameter commands the tractor-mounted trailer ABS optical warning signal.
挂车ABS报警信号";
CM_ SG_ 2566831883 Front_Axle_Speed "前轴平均速度";
CM_ SG_ 2566831883 Relative_Speed_FrontAxle_LeftWhe "前轴左侧轮相对于前轴的速度";
CM_ SG_ 2566831883 Relative_Speed_FrontAxle_RightWh "前轴右侧轮相对于前轴的速度";
CM_ SG_ 2566831883 Relative_Speed_RearAxle1_LeftWhe "后轴左侧轮相对于前轴的速度";
CM_ SG_ 2566831883 Relative_Speed_RearAxle1_RightWh "后轴右侧轮相对于前轴的速度";
CM_ SG_ 2566831883 Relative_Speed_RearAxle2_LeftWhe "第三轴左侧轮相对于前轴的速度";
CM_ SG_ 2566831883 Relative_Speed_RearAxle2_RightWh "第三轴右侧轮相对于前轴的速度";
CM_ BO_ 2566767627 "Electronic Brake Controller 5
Used for information on brake control.";
CM_ SG_ 2566767627 BrakeTempWarning "This parameter indicates if the temperature in the service brakes exceeds a certain value. It can be used for a warning information for the driver. The temperature warning value is vehicle manufacturer specific.
制动器高温警报";
CM_ SG_ 2566767627 HaltBrakeMode "Signal which indicates the current mode of the halt brake function.
停车制动";
CM_ SG_ 2566767627 HillHolderMode "Signal which indicates the current mode of the hill holder function.
坡路防滑模式";
CM_ SG_ 2566767627 FoundationBrakeUse "This parameter indicates if the brake system presently uses the foundation brakes.
当前制动系统是否使用基础制动。";
CM_ SG_ 2566767627 XBRSystemState "This parameter indicates which external brake control is allowed.
该参数表示允许哪个外部制动控制。";
CM_ SG_ 2566767627 XBRActiveCtrlMode "This parameter indicates which XBR Control Mode is executed by the brake system.
该参数表示制动系统执行哪种XBR控制模式。";
CM_ SG_ 2566767627 XBRAccelerationLimit "The brake system may temporarily or generally limit the maximum brake performance available for external systems. A temporarylimit may be nessary due to high brake temperature; a general limit may be defined by the vehicle manufacturer,The actual limit iscommunicated to the external systems that request braking.
制动系统可能暂时或一般地限制外部系统的最大制动性能。由于制动温度过高，可能需要临时限制;汽车制造商可能会定义一个通用限值，例如，由于责任原因，限值为-2.5 m/s?。实际限制是传达到请求制动的外部系统。此限制仅在XBR优先级1~3中有效。它被指定为相对于道路的绝对加速度。";
CM_ SG_ 2566767627 EmergencyBrakingActive "Signal which indicates an emergency braking situation with high deceleration values. This signal can be used to activate thehazard lights to indicate other road users to the rear and front of the vehicle that a high retardation force has been applied to thevehicle relative to the prevailing road conditions.
指示高减速值紧急制动状况的信号(参考ECE Regulation 13 paragraph 5.2.1.31)。此信号可用于激活危险警报灯(参考ECEECE Regulation 13 paragraph 5.2.1.31)";
CM_ BO_ 2565868307 "EPS Output - PGN which indicates the actual angle and the status of a steerable axle";
CM_ SG_ 2565868307 ActualInnerWheelSteerAngle "Signal which indicates the actual inner wheel steering angle.  The steering angle is the angle of wheel turn relative to the vehicle x-axis (yaw angle of inner wheel). See Figure SPN2927_A for explanation of positive and negative angles. 
指示实际内轮转向角度的信号。转向角度是车轮相对于车辆x轴的角度(内车轮的偏航角)。左负右正";
CM_ SG_ 2565868307 AxleLocation "To identify to which of several similar devices (such as tires or fuel tanks) the information applies.The low order 4 bits represent a position number, counting left to right when facing in the direction of normal vehicle travel(forward).The high order 4 bits represent a position number, counting front to back on the vehicle.The value FFh indicates notavailable.It is recommended that output devices add 1 to the position number (range 1 to 15, not 0 to 14) for use by drivers and servicetechnicians. Examples
以确定几个类似的设备(如轮胎或油箱)中的哪一个适用该信息。
低阶4位代表一个位置号，当面对正常车辆行驶(前进)的方向时，从左到右计算。高阶4位代表一个位置号，在车辆上从前到后计算。
0xFF表示不可用。
建议输出设备在位置号上加1(范围为1 ~ 15，而不是0 ~ 14)，以便司机和维修人员使用。例如:0x00位置的轮胎压力是左前胎。
在3轴牵引车(3轴，4胎)上，0x23位置的胎压应该在两侧都有双轴的后外侧。";
CM_ SG_ 2565868307 StatusOfSteerAxle "A signal which indicates different states of the steering axle";
CM_ SG_ 2565868307 SteerableLiftAxleLoweringInhibit "A signal which indicates if lowering of lifted axle is allowed or inhibited.
指示已生气的转向轴是允许还是禁止下降。";
CM_ SG_ 2565868307 SteerType "Indicates the different types of steering systems (ref. ECE Regulation 79 paragraph 2.5)
指示不同类型的转向系统
0-Main steering system主要转向（决定车的前进方向，本项目默认1）
1-Auxiliary steering equipment次要转向
2-E：Reserved for Assignment by SAE
F:不可用";
CM_ SG_ 2565868307 TypeOfSteerForces "Type of Steering Forces (Ref. ECE Regulation 79 paragraph 2.5)
转向力类型";
CM_ SG_ 2565868307 TypeOfSteerTrans "Type of Steering Transmission (Ref. ECE Regulation 79 paragraph 2.6)
转向传动系类型";
CM_ SG_ 2566811659 PoweredVehicleWeight "Total mass imposed by the tires of the powered vehicle on the road surface. Does not include the";
CM_ SG_ 2566811659 GrossCombinationVehicleWeight "The total weight of the truck and all attached trailers.";
CM_ BO_ 2565867787 "Vehicle Dynamic StabilityControl 2";
CM_ SG_ 2565867787 SteerWheelAngle "The main operator`s steering wheel angle (on the steering column, not the actual wheel angle). The vehicle being steered to theleft (counterclockwise) results in a positive steering wheel angle.
驾驶位方向盘角度(在转向柱上，不是实际的车轮角度)。左正右负。";
CM_ SG_ 2565867787 SteerWheelTurnCounter "Indicates number of steering wheel turns, absolute position or relative position at ignition on. Positive values indicate left turns.
指示方向盘转动圈数，点火时的绝对位置或相对位置";
CM_ SG_ 2565867787 SteerWheelAngleSensorType "Indicates whether the steering wheel angle sensor is capable of absolute measuring of the number of steering wheel turns or not (relative measuring to position at ignition on).
指示方向盘转角传感器是否能够绝对测量方向盘转动次数(相对于点火位置)。";
CM_ SG_ 2565867787 YawRate "Indicates the rate of rotation about the vertical axis (i.e. the z-axis).  A positive yaw rate signal results when the vehicle turns counter-clockwise.";
CM_ SG_ 2565867787 LateralAcceleration "Indicates a lateral acceleration of the vehicle (the component of vehicle acceleration vector along the Y-axis). A positive lateral acceleration signal results when the vehicle is accelerated to the left.";
CM_ SG_ 2565867787 LongitudinalAcceleration "Indicates the longitudinal acceleration of the vehicle. A positive longitudinal acceleration signal results when the vehicle speedincreases, regardless of driving the vehicle forward or backward.";
CM_ BO_ 2365473062 "Lighting Command
The lighting command message has been defined as a global message from the tractor to all lighting controllers on the tractor and attached implements.  Separate messages are provided for tractor and implement work and driving ...";
