CM_ SG_ 2365473062 LowBeamHeadLightCmd_1 "Command to activate or de-activate the tractor low beam head light lamps.";
CM_ SG_ 2365473062 HighBeamHeadLightCmd_1 "Command to activate or de-activate the tractor high beam head light lamps.";
CM_ SG_ 2365473062 TractorFrontFogLightsCmd_1 "Command to activate or de-activate tractor front fog lights.";
