CM_ SG_ 2365473062 LeftTurnSignalLightsCmd_1 "Command to activate or de-activate left turn signal lights on the tractor and all connected implements";
CM_ SG_ 2365473062 BackUpLightAndAlarmHornCmd_1 "Command to activate or de-activate the back up lights and/ or associated alarm if required";
CM_ SG_ 2365473062 implement_marker_light_command_1 "Command to activate or de-activate implement front position lights, rear red tail lights, side amber running lights,licenseplate lights and instrument and switch back lights.激活或关闭执行前位置灯，后红色尾灯，侧面琥珀色行驶灯，车牌灯和仪器和开关后灯命令。";
