CM_ SG_ 2364539648 AcceleratorPedal1LowIdleSwitch "Switch signal which indicates the state of the accelerator pedal 1 low idle switch.";
CM_ SG_ 2364539648 AcceleratorPedalKickdownSwitch "Switch signal which indicates whether the accelerator pedal kickdown switch is opened or closed.";
CM_ SG_ 2364539648 AcceleratorPedalPosition "The ratio of actual accelerator pedal position to maximum pedal position. Although it is used as aninput to determine powertrain demand, it also provides anticipatory information to transmission andASR algorithms about driver actions";
CM_ SG_ 2364539648 PercentLoadAtCurrentSpeed "The ratio of actual engine percent torque (indicated) to maximum indicated torque available at thecurrent engine speed, clipped to zero torque during engine braking.";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 OverrideCtrlMode_ACCE "The override control mode defines which sort of command is used.
发动机控制模式";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 ReqSpdCtrlConditions_ACCE "This mode tells the engine control system the governor characteristics that are desired during speed control.
速度控制时用的
0x0:针对传动系统脱离和非锁定情况进行的瞬态优化
0x1:为传动系统脱离和非锁定条件优化的稳定性
0x2:针对传动系统啮合和/或处于锁定状态1的稳定性进行了优化
0x3:为传动系统啮合和/或处于锁定状态而优化的稳定性2";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 OverrideCtrlModePriority_ACCE "This field is used as an input to the engine or retarder to determine thepriority of the Override Control Mode received in theTorque/Speed Control message (see PGN 0). The default is 11 (Low priority). It is not required to use the same priority duringthe entire override function. For example, the transmission can use priority 01 (High priority) during a shift, but can set thepriority to 11 (Low priority) at the end of the shift to allow traction control to also interact with the torque limit of the engine.
该字段被用作发动机或减速机的输入，以确定在转矩/速度控制消息中接收到的超驰控制模式的优先级(参见PGN 0)。默认值是11(低优先级)。在整个override函数中不需要使用相同的优先级。例如，变速器在换挡时可以使用优先级01(高优先级)，但在换挡结束时可以将优先级设置为11(低优先级)，以便牵引力控制也可以与发动机的扭矩限制相互作用。";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 TorqReqOrTorqLimitReq_ACCE "Parameter provided to the engine or retarder in the torque/speed control message for controlling or limiting the output torque.Requested torque to the engine is measured in indicated torque as a percentage of reference engine torque. This is the enginetorque at which the engine is expected to operate if the torque control mode is active or the engine torque which the engine is notexpected to exceed if the torque limit mode is active
在转矩/速度控制信息中提供给发动机或减速机的参数，用于控制或限制输出转矩。要求的发动机转矩是用指示转矩作为参考发动机转矩的百分比来测量的。这是在转矩控制模式为Auto模式时发动机预期运行的发动机转矩，或在转矩限制模式为Auto模式时发动机预期不会超过的发动机转矩";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 TSC1TransRate_ACCE "This parameter indicates the transmission rate at which the sending device will transmit the TSC1 message. The engine shall adjust its timeout for TSC1 messages accordingly. Variable TSC1 transmission rates shall only apply to messages sent to the engine.
该参数表示发送设备发送TSC1消息的传输速率。引擎应相应地调整TSC1消息的超时时间。可变的TSC1传输速率仅适用于发送到发动机的消息。";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 TSC1CtrlPurpose_ACCE "State signal which indicates which control mode the sending device is using to generate the TSC1 command. Note that the modes are not in prioritized order. Not all modes may be relevant for a given device. Some devices may not implement all functions. The TSC1 control purpose shall only apply to messages sent to the engine.
指示发送设备使用哪种控制模式来生成TSC1命令。注意，这些模式并不是按照优先顺序排列的。并非所有模式都适用于特定设备。有些设备可能不能实现所有的功能。TSC1的控制用途仅适用于发送给发动机的消息。";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 EngReqTorqueHighResolution_ACCE "This parameter displays an additional torque in percent of the reference engine torque.
发动机扭矩请求的小数部分";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 MessageCounter_ACCE "The message counter is used to detect situations where the transmitting ECU malfunction repeats the same frame all the time.The receiver of the formation may use the counter parameter to detect this situation. The transmitting device will increase themessage counter in every cycle. The message counter will count from 0 to 7 and then wrap. The values 0x8 thru 0xE are SAEreserved and should be ignored by the receiver.Value 0xF (all bits set to 1) will indicate that the message counter is not available.For co";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 MessageChecksum_ACCE "The message checksum is used to verify the signal path from the transmitting device to the receiving device.The message checksum is calculated using the first 7 data bytes, the message counter and the bytes of the messageidentifier. It is calculated as follows:Checksum = (Byte1 + Byte2 + Byte3 + Byte4 + Byte5 + Byte6 + Byte7 + message counter & 0x0F + message ID low byte +message ID mid low byte + message ID mid high byte + message ID high byte)Message Checksum = (((Checksum >> 6) & 0x03) + (Checksum >>3)";
CM_ SG_ 2349075360 ExternalTargetDecelReq "用于表示外部的目标减速度需求。";
CM_ SG_ 2349075360 EBIMode "表示EBI控制模式。";
CM_ SG_ 2349075360 ExternalBrakeReqPriority "外部制动请求优先级";
CM_ SG_ 2349075360 ExternalBrakeReqCtrlMode "外部制动请求控制模式";
CM_ SG_ 2349075360 RollingCounter "报文计数器用于检测由于报文发送者故障导致重复发生同一帧报文。报文接收者可以使用报文计数器检测到这种情况。报文发送者在每个报文发送周期令报文计数器增1，报文计时器从0开始计数直到15，然后再从0开始计数。";
CM_ SG_ 2349075360 CheckSum "报文校验和用于验证从发送设备到接收设备的信号传输路径。校验和是下述数据的和：报文ID由高字节至低字节的和、数据区前7个字节以及报文计数器。校验和计算公式如下：
校验和 = (字节1 + 字节2 + 字节3 + 字节4 + 字节5 +字节6 + 字节7 + 报文计数器 & 0x0F + 报文ID低字节+ 报文ID中低字节 + 报文ID中高字节 + 报文ID高字节)
校验和 = ((校验和 >> 4) + 校验和) & 0x0F";
CM_ SG_ 2348875814 TransmissionGearReq "表示驾驶员、ADV、ABS或发动机请求档位。(MT车型档位显示，AMT车型取消该信号）
负数表示倒档, 正值表示前进档, 0表示空挡。
特殊取值定义如下:
0xFD (253 dec) = 保持当前档位(D(手动))
0xFC (252 dec) = 前进档位(D(自动))
0xF0 (240 dec)- 0xFB (251 dec) = 保留
0xE0 (224 dec) = 档位不确定或者无按键按下
0xDF (223 dec) = 倒档档位选择(倒档)
0xE1 - 0xEF(225 dec - 239 dec) = 保留
0xDE - 0xBE (222 dec - 190 dec) = 保留
0x3C - 0x00 (60 dec - 0 dec) = 保留
注:0x7D(125 dec)=空挡";
